WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.001 --> 00:00:02.849
Roxy landed.

2
00:00:02.850 --> 00:00:06.202
Zombies stumbled out of Shop Well Supermarket.

3
00:00:06.203 --> 00:00:09.010
Crumbs were stuck to their mouths.

4
00:00:09.011 --> 00:00:13.124
Roxy saw a Le Sweet wrapper stuck to one zombie.

5
00:00:13.125 --> 00:00:18.080
Roxy gasped. "That zombie is the Mighty Man actor!"

6
00:00:18.081 --> 00:00:20.190
People were running and shouting.

7
00:00:20.191 --> 00:00:27.476
"Ahh! Zombies!" an old man cried.

8
00:00:27.477 --> 00:00:30.374
Three teenagers started to race away.

9
00:00:30.375 --> 00:00:32.758
Then one held up his phone.

10
00:00:32.759 --> 00:00:36.530
"I'm going to take a selfie with—Ahh!"

11
00:00:36.531 --> 00:00:42.001
"Grargh!" The Mighty Man zombie chomped the phone and then spit it out.

12
00:00:42.002 --> 00:00:44.546
The boy ran after his friends.

13
00:00:44.547 --> 00:00:47.632
Roxy saw several people huddled on top of a cab.

14
00:00:47.633 --> 00:00:54.551
"Rocket Girl, save us!" Zombies reached up, grabbing at the people.

15
00:00:54.552 --> 00:00:57.620
An old man swung his cane at the zombies.

16
00:00:57.621 --> 00:01:01.145
"Get away from us, you monsters!"

17
00:01:01.146 --> 00:01:03.819
Zoom! Roxy shot through the air.

18
00:01:03.820 --> 00:01:06.315
She blew her super breath.

19
00:01:06.316 --> 00:01:09.956
The zombies tumbled and rolled over each other.

20
00:01:09.957 --> 00:01:12.459
"Run!" Roxy told the people.

21
00:01:12.460 --> 00:01:18.124
"Find somewhere to hide. I'll be back soon!"

22
00:01:18.125 --> 00:01:21.191
*** Roxy flew to Le Sweet's

23
00:01:21.192 --> 00:01:24.339
Bakery. Inside, huge ovens lined one

24
00:01:24.340 --> 00:01:26.933
wall. Machines hummed

25
00:01:26.934 --> 00:01:30.892
loudly. Long belts filled with donuts rolled along

26
00:01:30.893 --> 00:01:33.741
slowly. One machine squirted icing onto

27
00:01:33.742 --> 00:01:37.474
donuts. Another machine dunked donuts into a tub of

28
00:01:37.475 --> 00:01:39.893
chocolate. "I have to shut this place down.

29
00:01:39.894 --> 00:01:45.562
It's making donuts—and zombies!"

30
00:01:45.563 --> 00:01:49.909
Roxy turned everything off.

31
00:01:49.910 --> 00:01:53.649
The bakery became still and silent.

32
00:01:53.650 --> 00:01:57.327
A second later Roxy heard footsteps.

33
00:01:57.328 --> 00:02:01.737
A man with an apron and a tall white hat hurried in.

34
00:02:01.738 --> 00:02:05.105
"What happened?" he cried.

35
00:02:05.106 --> 00:02:09.185
Then he spotted Roxy. "Rocket Girl!"

36
00:02:09.186 --> 00:02:11.637
"Sorry, sir," Roxy said.

37
00:02:11.638 --> 00:02:13.254
"You might not know this.

38
00:02:13.255 --> 00:02:17.676
But your donuts are causing a big problem. You see—"

39
00:02:17.677 --> 00:02:22.932
"You think you can stop me, do you?" The man glared at Roxy.

40
00:02:22.933 --> 00:02:25.739
"Huh?" Roxy was confused.

41
00:02:25.740 --> 00:02:27.163
The man continued.

42
00:02:27.164 --> 00:02:29.739
"My name is Pete Le Sweet.

43
00:02:29.740 --> 00:02:32.412
I invented a special donut recipe.

44
00:02:32.413 --> 00:02:37.732
It's so good, everybody will be hungry for one thing—my donuts!"

45
00:02:37.733 --> 00:02:43.236
He laughed. "And you won't stop me, Rocket Girl!"

46
00:02:43.237 --> 00:02:44.965
Roxy narrowed her eyes.

47
00:02:44.966 --> 00:02:50.300
"You planned to turn people into zombies? It wasn't an accident?"

48
00:02:50.301 --> 00:02:54.673
Le Sweet raised an eyebrow. "Huh? Zombies?"

49
00:02:54.674 --> 00:02:56.788
Roxy put her hands on her hips.

50
00:02:56.789 --> 00:03:00.138
"Your special recipe stinks, Le Sweet.

51
00:03:00.139 --> 00:03:03.854
Your donuts are turning people into zombies!"

52
00:03:03.855 --> 00:03:05.493
Le Sweet shrugged.

53
00:03:05.494 --> 00:03:08.860
"As long as I'm selling lots of donuts, who cares?"

54
00:03:08.861 --> 00:03:10.684
He put his hand on a lever.

55
00:03:10.685 --> 00:03:13.254
"Good-bye, Rocket Girl."

56
00:03:13.255 --> 00:03:16.396
Le Sweet pulled the lever.

57
00:03:16.397 --> 00:03:23.277
Chocolate syrup rushed out, completely covering Roxy!

